# Title: CobaltStrike Named Pipe
# ID: d5601f8c-b26f-4ab0-9035-69e11a8d4ad2
# Status: test
# Level: critical
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Wojciech Lesicki
# Date: 2021-05-25
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.stealth, attack.t1055
# Description: Detects the creation of a named pipe as used by CobaltStrike
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((PipeName CONTAIN "\\MSSE-" AND PipeName CONTAIN "-server")) OR (PipeName="\\interprocess_*") OR (PipeName="\\lsarpc_*") OR (PipeName="\\mojo_*") OR (PipeName="\\msagent_*") OR (PipeName="\\netlogon_*") OR (PipeName="\\postex_*") OR (PipeName="\\samr_*") OR (PipeName="\\srvsvc_*") OR (PipeName="\\status_*") OR (PipeName="\\wkssvc_*"))
